      "value": "It continues to occur in [1260].\nIt appears that only the first Favolite List opened immediately after VRChat startup is sorted correctly, and the other lists are sorted in Add Date order.\nI am not sure if this only occurs when Name sorting is specified, or if it has something to do with features such as editing the Favolite List on the website. ......",
