  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRChat Version: Build 1258 (even before that)\n\nDescription of the bug:\nAfter launching VRChat, when the World tab is opened from MM and the Favorite List is opened, the list is sometimes displayed in a different order (as far as I can see, in the order of \"Date Added\") even though the \"SORTED BY\" in the upper right corner is \"Name\".\n\nSo far, some listings occur and some do not, but the ones that do are reproduced almost 100% of the time. (Even when it does occur, the listings are sorted in the correct order when \"SORTED BY\" is specified again with \"Name\").\n\n\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?):\nAs above.\n\nAs far as I can see, it reproduces in PC Desktop and PC VR modes.\nI am not sure in other modes.\n\n\nAny extra files? (output logs, screenshots):\nAttached.\n\n\n\nI translated it from Japanese to English using DeepL, so I apologize if it is difficult to read.",
